# oracle: w307min_style_reset — min_style makes a new minimizer (src/update.cpp Update::create_minimize), so min_modify settings given before it are back at their defaults: min_modify dmax 0.01 then min_style quickmin, then min_modify integrator verlet then min_style fire
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.0e-15, atoms 6.4e-14.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
displace_atoms  all random 0.1 0.1 0.1 87287
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
thermo          5
thermo_style    custom step pe fnorm
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
min_modify      dmax 0.01
min_style       quickmin
minimize        0 0 10 100
min_modify      integrator verlet dmax 0.02
min_style       fire
minimize        0 0 20 100
